OL,3,GNEWSALove Islander channels online
OL,4,Acriticism in new role
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Strictly Come Dancing finalist and
OL,7,FLove Island winner says she has
OL,8,Fchannelled criticism she received
OL,9,Fonline into playing the role of Elle
OL,10,FWoods in Legally Blonde.
OL,12,FA musical adaptation of the 2001 film
OL,13,Fstarring Reese Witherspoon will see
OL,14,FAmber Davies play Woods, who after
OL,15,Fenrolling in Harvard Law School is
OL,16,Frepeatedly underestimated by her peers.
OL,18,FDavies, who is set to perform at
OL,19,FBrighton's Theatre Royal, says she can
OL,20,Fsee the parallels between herself and
OL,21,FWoods.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
