OL,3,GNEWSALove Islander channels online
OL,4,Acriticism in new role
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "I did a lot of having to
OL,7,Fprove myself in the start of my career,
OL,8,Fespecially when it came to cast
OL,9,Fannouncement days. I thought,
OL,10,F'everybody online, what are they going
OL,11,Fto say?'."
